      "index": 0,
      "text": "The Harbingers have kept the <i>Orion's Belt</i> at the zenith jump oint but their main landing fleet keeps heading towards Coromodir IV.\n\nSo far we have identified the signatures of several <i>Leopards<i> and <i>Unions</i> and from their total estimated mass, I would say there's a least the equivalent of a regiment heading towards us.",
