    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9cb7c0fe2d4f092d832dec3f"
      },
      "index": 1,
      "text": "We ordered back all of our remaining forces to Coromodir except for a few units defending Panzyr and Tyrlon and counting the Royal Guard, Aurigan house troops and mercenary and allied units, we have a reinforced battalion to defend Coromodir IV and Cordia City of conventional and 'Mech forces.\n\nBut against one regiment using Star League 'Mechs, the odds are clearly not in our favor here.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
