    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c509a33a983000f0cac7542"
      },
      "index": 5,
      "text": "Again, the defense plans for this world are garbage because they assume that your raiders will follow any laws of war.\n\nOnce <i>Orion's Belt</i> arrives in orbit and begins conducting orbital bombardments and terror raids to force you to respond and spread your forces.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
