    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c5f041e7a63ad839fec44f8"
      },
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Because that's what would do?\n\nWhat you are saying might be possible, but we can't be planning for every situation the Harbingers might throw at us.",
