      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c9418bb3801894ef416e5e5"
      },
      "index": 8,
      "text": "By concentrating our forces around Cardia City we are limiting the damage caused by the fighting and it also gives the opportunity to better reinforce each our fortified positions.\n\nYour previous suggestion of gathering our forces for a decisive battle is too risky.",
