      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c9f6797d3cb32ba896c53de"
      },
      "index": 9,
      "text": "Just like your tactical manuals that call for insane battle rules that yourself won't follow.\n\nMore production to go find vodka, Fuck your mother, I am done with this meeting, Actual, come and see me when this is over.",
